1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:19,632
We developed QuakeSense: local LLM leaders + resident agents +
real city networks + an inspectable WebGIS.

2
00:00:19,632 --> 00:00:37,416
60 points: functional value, innovation, UX. 40 points: AMD Radeon
+ ROCm local inference and optimization.

3
00:00:37,416 --> 00:00:59,352
Real inputs → agent reasoning → validated tools → simulator state
change → inspectable WebGIS.

4
00:00:59,352 --> 00:01:20,136
Every 10 minutes: observe → reason with memory → plan → validated
tool → execute → replan.

5
00:01:20,136 --> 00:01:39,960
Xi'an: 350 leaders · 4,242 decisions · 0 failed or unparseable ·
100% applied.

6
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:58,656
Baseline control: LLM leaders, broadcasts, and leader memory are
disabled.

7
00:01:58,656 --> 00:02:17,544
LLM guidance activates the full command cycle with 32 slots and
0.285 s mean decision time.

8
00:02:17,544 --> 00:02:36,912
Playback exposes how broadcasts update resident beliefs, routes,
placement, abandonment, and safety.

9
00:02:36,912 --> 00:02:58,008
Road tiers are visible and computational: they constrain access,
routing, congestion, and agent choices.

10
00:02:58,008 --> 00:03:17,568
One agent contract runs across ten different city networks and
capacity structures.

11
00:03:17,568 --> 00:03:36,792
At 15 minutes, six of eight global cities improve; the effect is
material but not universal.

12
00:03:36,792 --> 00:03:56,688
At 120 minutes, some effects reverse as leadership interacts with
physical constraints.

13
00:03:56,688 --> 00:04:14,160
Local Radeon gfx1100 + ROCm 7.2.1 · Qwen2.5-7B · 32 slots · 88.5
tok/s.

14
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:37,584
Q4 quantization · full GPU offload · batching · constrained JSON ·
shared-VRAM protection.

15
00:04:37,584 --> 00:04:59,520
Judge proof: open WebGIS → compare baseline/LLM → play → show GPU
health and validated metrics.

16
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:19,488
Working application + executed Agentic AI tools + measured local
Radeon/ROCm inference.
